Levik WhiteList Relay licensing
================================

This source tree contains separately licensed components; no relicensing of
upstream work is intended.

* `fork/wdtt-plus-v15/` is licensed under GPL-3.0-only. Its complete license
  text is in `fork/wdtt-plus-v15/LICENSE`.
* `node-agent/` is original Levik work licensed under AGPL-3.0-only. Its
  complete license text is in `node-agent/LICENSE`.
* Original Levik contracts, build/provenance scripts, and documentation
  outside the fork are licensed under AGPL-3.0-only.
* The qWDTT-derived portion identified in `NOTICE` remains GPL-3.0-only.

Exact source provenance and excluded material are recorded in `NOTICE` and
`source/upstream.lock.json`.
